{"3978520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DECEIVED", "steam_appid": 3978520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DECEIVED</i></strong> is a <i>psychological horror</i> game. You find yourself in a loop, but every time you loop, something changes, it looks the same, but is it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, find clues and puzzles that will help you  reveal the truth of what really happened that night inside the Walker residence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/8524f1e8fd18b1920ff10e01ca126cd4.poster.avif?t=1787659319\" width=608 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/8524f1e8fd18b1920ff10e01ca126cd4.webm?t=1787659319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/8524f1e8fd18b1920ff10e01ca126cd4.mp4?t=1787659319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>IMMERSIVE HORROR EXPERIENCE</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Am I hallucinating? or is it real?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining visuals and audio cues to deliver a unique experience in horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/91f47cfc9695a7a6bc2d17d56e3058d2.poster.avif?t=1787659319\" width=608 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/91f47cfc9695a7a6bc2d17d56e3058d2.webm?t=1787659319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/91f47cfc9695a7a6bc2d17d56e3058d2.mp4?t=1787659319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>PUZZLES AND CLUES</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;What was that?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues and solve puzzles whilst exploring the eerie hallways to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/e854aa3c7e2a850eff6e86fdd6b82c17.poster.avif?t=1787659319\" width=608 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/e854aa3c7e2a850eff6e86fdd6b82c17.webm?t=1787659319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/e854aa3c7e2a850eff6e86fdd6b82c17.mp4?t=1787659319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>NEVER ENDING LOOP</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I just went through this door, why am I in the same place?&quot;</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you loop, the environment changes, interact with the environment and experience the horror of the Walker residence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/e87a3513d0e38d7ec23e7d30b7753cc5.poster.avif?t=1787659319\" width=608 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/e87a3513d0e38d7ec23e7d30b7753cc5.webm?t=1787659319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/e87a3513d0e38d7ec23e7d30b7753cc5.mp4?t=1787659319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>STORY-RICH GAMEPLAY</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;That, that can't be.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully crafted story and gameplay enhance immersion and amplify the horror.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DECEIVED</i></strong> is a <i>psychological horror</i> game. You find yourself in a loop, but every time you loop, something changes, it looks the same, but is it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, find clues and puzzles that will help you  reveal the truth of what really happened that night inside the Walker residence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/8524f1e8fd18b1920ff10e01ca126cd4.poster.avif?t=1787659319\" width=608 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/8524f1e8fd18b1920ff10e01ca126cd4.webm?t=1787659319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/8524f1e8fd18b1920ff10e01ca126cd4.mp4?t=1787659319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>IMMERSIVE HORROR EXPERIENCE</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Am I hallucinating? or is it real?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining visuals and audio cues to deliver a unique experience in horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/91f47cfc9695a7a6bc2d17d56e3058d2.poster.avif?t=1787659319\" width=608 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c